The web page in web/ bundles the JavaScript port of arabic-normalize by Bayanat
Labs (web/lib/, Apache-2.0, from https://github.com/Bayanat-Labs/arabic-normalize
at commit dcc7f31cc5ae8b7b09e3de8401dcebe7aabc0240). Its generated tables
(web/lib/generated/ucd-data.js) are derived from the Unicode Character Database,
version 18.0.0, and are covered by the Unicode License V3; the full copyright and
permission notice is in NOTICE-unicode.txt. Copyright (c) 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc.

The web page also bundles the IBM Plex Sans Arabic font, version 1.005: the
unmodified files IBMPlexSansArabic-Regular.woff2 and IBMPlexSansArabic-SemiBold.woff2
from IBM's npm package @ibm/plex-sans-arabic 1.1.0. Copyright 2017 IBM Corp. with
Reserved Font Name "Plex". Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
(web/fonts/OFL.txt). The font is not part of the Python package.

Runtime dependencies of the Python package: arabic-normalize (Apache-2.0, Bayanat
Labs) and RapidFuzz (MIT). jiwer (Apache-2.0) is optional and used in tests. No
third-party code is copied into this repository.

casestudy/references.jsonl contains reference transcriptions from FLEURS
(google/fleurs, copyright Google, CC BY 4.0). The case-study hypotheses were
produced by Bayanat Labs with openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo (MIT) and
openai/whisper-small (Apache-2.0 per its model card), run through their
faster-whisper conversions (MIT). No audio is included in this repository.

